"External input / real-time message stream\n"
"        │ (milliseconds)\n"
"        ▼\n"
"① Instant memory ─── Internal activation state during LLM token inference\n"
"        │ (attention filtering)\n"
"        ▼\n"
"② Working memory ─── LLM context window (current session)\n"
